  "note": [
    "The Mini Booth's fabric, cut from the one Lawanda layout in scripts/fabric-lawanda.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. MINI-BOOTH v2: 3.4 x 3.2 x 4.2, the eye at the middle, barely large enough for one person, lit by one soft warm fixture. On the back (south) wall the small ridged slot at x -0.55 and the ten-key numeric keyboard at x 0.45. No screen, no ready lamp: activation is spoken, and the 'sign flashes' messages are text only.",
